comic-dl (0.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Debian-native runtime dependencies where available (bs4, lxml, rich,
    platformdirs, defusedxml, certifi, cffi).
  * curl-cffi (not packaged in Debian) vendored as an abi3 wheel under
    /usr/lib/comic-dl/site-packages; /usr/bin/comic-dl launcher injects it
    via PYTHONPATH.

 -- Comic Downloader contributors <maintainers@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
